title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/metarecord:bulk
catalog: GUI command
target: metarecord:bulk
summary: Bulk operation on the selection or the current query

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``metarecord-detail`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``m m a`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection add``
* ``m m d`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection delete``
* ``m m r`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection remove``
* ``m m s`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection set``
* ``m m u`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection unset``
* ``m q a`` → ``metarecord:bulk query add``
* ``m q d`` → ``metarecord:bulk query delete``
* ``m q r`` → ``metarecord:bulk query remove``
* ``m q s`` → ``metarecord:bulk query set``
* ``m q u`` → ``metarecord:bulk query unset``
* ``shift+m a`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection add``
* ``shift+m d`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection delete``
* ``shift+m r`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection remove``
* ``shift+m s`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection set``
* ``shift+m u`` → ``metarecord:bulk selection unset``
